{"parse": {"title": "达达泊兽", "pageid": 2268, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"达达泊兽\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6a/Item-160002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"达达泊兽\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>达达泊兽</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#160002</div></div><hr /><div>稀有的达泊兽。使用后，关卡获得的收获变为先前的四倍。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">在神秘学界，为它们而一掷千金的人不在少数。人人都想拥有它，但又无人能真正地拥有它，它们总是突然地出现，又突然地消失，徒留一地“珍稀之物”。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "达达泊兽"}}